This was a fun game. I was rolling up random characters, just to play more 
than
to try to ascend when I got a knight. I don't think I've played a knight in 
3.4x
though I ascended one in an earlier version. IIRC the riding and jousting
weren't in that version. This may have been the first character I've named 
after
myself even if I did come up a female! About the only difference that makes 
in
my game is whether I name or number my foocubi. I just don't want to 
personalize
the incubi!

The beginnings were modest enough:

